PART 2. The explicit construction G_L (sequential certification with low rescues), FINITE-EXACT
====================================================================================================
  Every n <= N descends within L steps in G_L (independent re-run inside the C program); 'stuck' = n for which the
  rescue repertoire found no certificate (then G_L would not be a member).  Density = flipped pairs among pairs <= N/2
  (final: later rescues touch only pairs of larger points).

